# WP-LOADER-ADAPTERS (UE IWorldPartitionActorLoaderInterface + UWorldPartitionEditorLoaderAdapter): what the editor
# holds of a partitioned world is the UNION of its loaders - rectangles (FLoaderAdapterShape), Location Volumes
# (ALocationVolume, a component: Extent + Auto Load, always loaded in the editor, left out by the cook), entity
# lists (FLoaderAdapterActorList, Load Region from Selection) and pins (FLoaderAdapterPinnedActors) - beside the
# always-loaded part; Unload All switches every loader off but the pins. Kept per user in
# Saved/Config/WorldPartitionEditor.json (UWorldPartitionEditorPerProjectUserSettings) and loaded again at open.
# Lead: WP_Protocol has no lake - VILLAGE_X/Z, LAKE_ID and HOUSE_ID below are placeholders; pick a building cluster
# for the village, a building ~600 m away for the lake side and one building outside both for the house, from the
# map (World Partition panel, hover a cell) or the descriptor index, and replace them before the run.
# Lead: the palette entries "Add Location Volume", "Load location volume <name>", "Load Region from Selection",
# "Pin Selected" and "Remove loader <name>" are REMAINDER items of this branch (see the commit body).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Unload All"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Add Location Volume"
Дано --subject selection set Tag Village
Дано --subject selection set Translation VILLAGE_X,0,VILLAGE_Z
Дано --subject selection set Extent 15000,15000,15000
Дано run Action "Save Scene"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,180000,-1
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,0.0001
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Load location volume Village"
# The lake side: the entity list around one lake-side building (Load Region from Selection needs it loaded first,
# so Load All, select, list, then the whole-world flag goes again with Unload All - which keeps nothing but pins;
# hence the list is made AFTER the pin below and the volume is loaded again last).
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Когда select HOUSE_ID
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Pin Selected"
Когда select LAKE_ID
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Load Region from Selection"
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Unload loader All"
Тогда adapters_three вид сверху: загружены деревня (300x300 м вокруг Village) и озёрный край (здания вокруг LAKE_ID) - два острова - и один закреплённый дом HOUSE_ID вне обоих; в панели World Partition три строки загрузчиков: Village (Location Volume, Loaded), Selection 1 (N entities, Loaded), Pinned (1)
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene WP_Protocol.desce"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,180000,-1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,0.0001
Тогда adapters_restored после повторного открытия загружено то же самое, что в adapters_three (те же два острова и дом), в панели те же три строки
# Restore the frozen world: the volume leaves, the user's loaders go.
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Unload All"
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Unpin All"
Когда run Entity "Village"
Когда run Action "Delete"
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
